Useful plugin for Redmine written by Teddy Lerat.

Redmine 4 compatibility and testing by Kai Bosch from www.heureka.com

Redmine 7 port by VILT (2.0.0). The behaviour is unchanged: the hooks it uses
(controller_issues_new/edit/bulk_edit_before_save) and Issue#previous_assignee
still exist. Unlike Redmine 7's own auto-watch preferences, it does not require
the add_issue_watchers permission and it needs no per-user setting.

http://www.redmine.org/issues/2716
